  "description": "Current visual document understanding (VDU) models heavily rely on external OCR framework (<em>e.g.</em>, <a href=\"#baek2019craft\">text detection</a>,\n              <a href=\"#baek2019STR\">text recognition</a>).\n              OCR is expensive and sometimes not available.\n              We bravely remove the dependency of OCR by modeling a simple transformer architecture.\n              Take our highly efficient and powerful VDU model, Donut 🍩!"
}
